---
// KeyDiscoveriesCards.astro - 5 Core BMS Discoveries (Vertical Stacked Cards, 75% Width, Spacious Layout)
---

<div class="discoveries-container">
	<div class="discoveries-stack">
		<!-- Discovery #1 -->
		<div class="discovery-card">
			<div class="discovery-number">Discovery #1</div>
			<div class="discovery-emoji-group">
				<span class="discovery-emoji-item">🍺</span>
				<span class="discovery-emoji-item">🥤</span>
				<span class="discovery-emoji-item">☕</span>
				<div class="discovery-red-x" aria-hidden="true">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none">
						<line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
						<line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
					</svg>
				</div>
			</div>
			<h4 class="discovery-title">Beer, sodas, and coffee were a trigger for me</h4>
			<p class="discovery-desc">
				<strong>My discovery:</strong> Direct acidic drinks immediately burned my exposed oral nerves and triggered intense mouth pain upon&nbsp;contact.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Discovery #2 -->
		<div class="discovery-card">
			<div class="discovery-number">Discovery #2</div>
			<div class="discovery-emoji">🍌</div>
			<h4 class="discovery-title">Sugar is a direct trigger</h4>
			<p class="discovery-desc">
				<strong>My discovery:</strong> It converts into acid within minutes. Naturally occurring oral bacteria ferment sugars into corrosive lactic acid, bathing the teeth and gums in an invisible acid&nbsp;wash.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Discovery #3 -->
		<div class="discovery-card">
			<div class="discovery-number">Discovery #3</div>
			<div class="discovery-emoji">🥦</div>
			<h4 class="discovery-title">Every vegetable has sugar</h4>
			<p class="discovery-desc">
				<strong>My discovery:</strong> Just like fruits, all vegetables contain fermentable carbohydrates. At the stage I was at, even vegetable sugars were enough to trigger my nervous system and reignite the&nbsp;burn.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Discovery #4 -->
		<div class="discovery-card">
			<div class="discovery-number">Discovery #4</div>
			<div class="discovery-emoji">🥩</div>
			<h4 class="discovery-title">Meat has zero acid and zero sugar</h4>
			<p class="discovery-desc">
				<strong>My discovery:</strong> The carnivore diet—an ancestral way of eating humans have thrived on for millions of years—contains zero acid and zero sugar, completely starving the acid-producing bacteria in the&nbsp;mouth.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Discovery #5 -->
		<div class="discovery-card">
			<div class="discovery-number">Discovery #5</div>
			<div class="discovery-emoji">🦷</div>
			<h4 class="discovery-title">Dental repair has reduced pain as well</h4>
			<p class="discovery-desc">
				<strong>My discovery:</strong> Physical dental leaks allow acid to reach internal nerves. When I had a defective crown repaired, it completely removed all the pain from the lower half of my&nbsp;jaw.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.discoveries-container {
		width: 100%;
		margin: 2.5rem 0;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.discoveries-stack {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 2rem;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.discovery-card {
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		/* 75% of reading container width with generous spacious padding */
		width: 82%;
		max-width: 46ch;
		padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2.25rem 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		/* Enhanced deep drop shadow */
		box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
		transition: transform 0.22s ease, box-shadow 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	.discovery-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-4px);
		border-color: #cbd5e1;
		box-shadow: 0 22px 48px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12), 0 6px 16px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.08);
	}

	/* Discovery Number Label (Positioned cleanly above the emoji) */
	.discovery-number {
		font-family: var(--font-heading, system-ui, sans-serif);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #7c3aed;
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
		margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	/* 3D Emoji Hero & Group */
	.discovery-emoji {
		font-size: 3.75rem;
		line-height: 1;
		margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14));
		display: inline-block;
		transition: transform 0.25s ease;
	}

	.discovery-card:hover .discovery-emoji {
		transform: scale(1.12) rotate(-3deg);
	}

	.discovery-emoji-group {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
		position: relative;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
	}

	.discovery-emoji-item {
		font-size: 3.25rem;
		line-height: 1;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14));
		display: inline-block;
		transition: transform 0.25s ease;
	}

	.discovery-card:hover .discovery-emoji-item:nth-child(1) {
		transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg);
	}
	.discovery-card:hover .discovery-emoji-item:nth-child(2) {
		transform: scale(1.12);
	}
	.discovery-card:hover .discovery-emoji-item:nth-child(3) {
		transform: scale(1.08) rotate(4deg);
	}

	.discovery-red-x {
		position: absolute;
		top: -4px;
		right: -6px;
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 2px solid #fee2e2;
		border-radius: 50%;
		width: 32px;
		height: 32px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);
	}

	/* Card Title */
	.discovery-title {
		font-family: var(--font-heading, system-ui, sans-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.2vw, 1.65rem);
		font-weight: 900;
		color: #0f172a;
		margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		line-height: 1.22;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	/* Card Description */
	.discovery-desc {
		font-size: 1.02rem;
		color: #334155;
		line-height: 1.55;
		margin: 0;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.discovery-desc strong {
		color: #0f172a;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.discovery-card {
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 100%;
			padding: 2rem 1.35rem 1.85rem 1.35rem;
		}

		.discovery-emoji {
			font-size: 3.25rem;
		}
	}
</style>
